WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:04.400
Once you've initialized Tessle in your

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.400
project, it's recommended that you

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.880
integrate Tessle with your preferred AI

4
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:12.320
coding agent. In this video, we'll show

5
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:14.480
